      <h2>📊 What is ABC Analysis?</h2>
      <p>ABC Analysis helps you categorize menu items based on <strong>sales volume and profitability</strong>, allowing you to focus on what truly drives revenue.</p>

      <ul>
        <li>🅰 <strong>A-Category</strong> – High-value items that generate the most revenue (maintain quality & pricing).</li>
        <li>🅱 <strong>B-Category</strong> – Mid-value items that play a supporting role in profitability (optimize pricing & promotion).</li>
        <li>🅲 <strong>C-Category</strong> – Low-value items that contribute the least (consider reworking or removing).</li>
      </ul>

      <p>Use ABC Analysis to <strong>optimize menu pricing, reduce waste, and maximize profitability.</strong></p>
  </div>
</div>

